# reexport_entry

reexport_entry.mdk — S-doc-surface-truth hole (a): a re-exporting
`export import m.{...}` must produce one documented entry per member.
Mirrors `stdlib/list.mdk:8` (`export import core.{Filterable, filter,
filterMap}`), the tree's only real re-export.

## `triple`

```
triple : re-export of reexport_helper.triple
```

Re-exported so a reader of this module finds it here.

## `quadruple`

```
quadruple : Int -> Int
```

A local binding, so the page shows re-exports and own entries together.

